    "title": "Woman dies days after UTV crash in Spartanburg Co., coroner says - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Tyler Scott ,\n2 hours ago SPARTANBURG COUNTY, S.C. (FOX Carolina) - The Spartanburg County Coroner’s Office reports a woman has died after a UTV crash on Saturday. The coroner’s office said 48-year-old Nicole Wylie from Spartanburg was taken to the Spartanburg Regional Medical Center after the crash. She died at 3:45 p.m. on Wednesday. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
